WEBVTT

00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:03.097
What <b>do you like doing</b> at the weekend?

00:00:06.138 --> 00:00:07.453
<b>I love cooking.</b>

00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:12.247
<b>I like going for a walk.</b>

00:00:15.290 --> 00:00:17.050
<b>I don’t like studying.</b>

00:00:20.097 --> 00:00:22.002
<b>I hate getting up</b> early.